{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \r\n\r\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete\r\nGO:0006266 DNA ligation\r\nGO:1902972 premeiotic DNA replication DNA ligation\r\nGO:1902973 mitotic DNA replication DNA ligation\r\nGO:1902327 bacterial-type DNA replication DNA ligation\r\nGO:1902333 nuclear DNA replication DNA ligation\r\nGO:1904877 positive regulation of DNA ligase activity\r\nGO:1904875 regulation of DNA ligase activity\r\nGO:1902291 cell cycle DNA replication DNA ligation\r\nGO:0051103 DNA ligation involved in DNA repair\r\nGO:0051104 DNA-dependent DNA replication DNA ligation\r\nGO:0051102 DNA ligation involved in DNA recombination\r\nGO:0051107 negative regulation of DNA ligation\r\nGO:0051105 regulation of DNA ligation\r\nGO:0051106 positive regulation of DNA ligation\r\nGO:0006288 base-excision repair, DNA ligation\r\n\r\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/29219\r\n\r\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \r\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1bz2A6JHNwf12jQuq7WjaOQJq-vElVDqpzU1bjKvl5k8/edit?gid=0#gid=0\r\n\r\nImpacted groups: \r\nBHF-UCL\t3 DONE\r\nEcoCyc\t5 DONE\r\nMGI\t8\r\nMTBBASE\t3 DONE\r\nPINC\t2 DONE\r\nRGD\t2 DONE\r\nReactome\t2 DONE\r\nSGD\t4 DONE\r\nTAIR\t1 DONE\r\nUniProt\t15 DONE\r\nCACAO\t1\r\n\r\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\r\n----\r\n\r\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \r\nInterPro:IPR016306 DNA ligase, bacteriophage T7-type > GO:DNA ligation ; GO:0006266\r\nInterPro:IPR029710 DNA ligase 4 > GO:DNA ligation involved in DNA repair ; GO:0051103\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks.\r\n", "created_at": "2024-11-19T00:22:08Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0006266 DNA ligation and descendants", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-02-12T11:26:09Z"}
